Package: gerp
Type: Package
Title: Good Enough R Practices
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Martin", "Frigaard", , "mjfrigaard@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package helps users adopt a set of good enough computing
    practices when working with data. The methods are largely based on the
    paper, 'Good enough practices in scientific computing' by Wilson et al
    (2017) <doi:10.1371/journal.pcbi.1005510>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://mjfrigaard.github.io/gerp/
